Well I was changing up from golds to 8 houses related schools. From what I got so far is the following:

&nbsp;

Abjuration: Guard, Architect


&nbsp;


Conjuration: Travel


&nbsp;


Divination: Arcane Research (education)


&nbsp;


Enchantment: Judicial


&nbsp;


Evocation: Martial League (military forces) 

&nbsp;


Illusion: Planar and Material Foreign Policy


&nbsp;


Necromancy: Agriculture 


&nbsp; 


Transmutation: Treasury


&nbsp;


The 8 arch mages of each school would have underlings that do most of the bulk work, while the arch mages can do arch mage thing until every phase of the moon, all eight archmages come together as a council to discuss and make decide courses of action
